  "decision_basis": [
    "Atom.Header.Container is one scalar: actual Scope Unit name path or base Atom ID; root Project Declaration omission defaults to world.",
    "Header.Relations is optional. An Atom instance stores immediate containment once in Header.Container, without a duplicate IS_CONTAINED_BY instance fact under Header.Relations.",
    "Formal MODEL relation declarations remain in force; this packet does not retire IS_CONTAINED_BY/CONTAINS model semantics."
  ],
